{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53891","headline":"李珏白日冲天诗 · 李珏","name":"李珏白日冲天诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金字空中见，分明列姓名。\n三千功若满，云鹤自来迎。\n要警贪惏息，将萌宠辱惊。\n知之如不怠，霄汉是前程。\n（《灯下闲谈》卷下《升斗得仙》）（按：诗题中之李珏，爲扬子县之小贩，积功成仙，与作者姓名同。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李珏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53891.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53891","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}